asked for           status  error         what to do
a page of tickets      200  -             use it
page number 0          400  bad_request   stop: a retry won't help
no token               401  unauthorized  stop: a retry won't help
a ticket that isn't    404  not_found     stop: a retry won't help
the 5th request        429  rate_limited  wait 1 s, ask again
the 6th request        503  unavailable   wait a while, ask again
